ss=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257460/extras/fffd111a65b894714a894c6c9ee9e345.poster.avif?t=1727180286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257460/extras/fffd111a65b894714a894c6c9ee9e345.webm?t=1727180286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map based puzzles will give you access to the other parts of the map. You will need to solve them carefully in order to be able achieve your task.</p>",
